{"id":"capitale","lemma":"capitale","pos":"noun","rank":2871,"glosses":["capital, capital city","capital letter"],"ipa":"/ka.pi.tal/","audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/transcoded/5/54/Fr-capitale.ogg/Fr-capitale.ogg.mp3","gender":"f","forms":{"plural":"capitales"},"formAudio":{"capitales":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/2/2f/LL-Q150_%28fra%29-Lepticed7-capitales.wav"},"examples":[{"text":"C'est un sujet d'une importance capitale.","en":"This is a matter of the utmost importance.","words":[{"g":"it / that"},{"g":"is","l":"être"},{"g":"a"},{"g":"subject, topic"},{"g":"of / from"},{"g":"a"},{"g":"importance"},null]},{"text":"Le meurtre est passible de la peine capitale.","en":"Murder is punished by death.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/2250","words":[{"g":"the / it"},{"g":"murder"},{"g":"is","l":"être"},{"g":"punishable"},null,null,{"g":"trouble, effort"},null],"phrases":[[4,6,"of the"]]},{"text":"Le plus grand secret est d'importance capitale.","en":"Absolute secrecy is paramount.","words":[{"g":"the / it"},{"g":"more / no longer"},{"g":"big"},{"g":"secret"},{"g":"is","l":"être"},{"g":"of / from"},{"g":"importance"},null]},{"text":"Les rebelles ont pris le contrôle de la capitale.","en":"The rebels took control of the capital.","words":[{"g":"the / them","l":"le"},{"g":"rebellious","l":"rebelle"},{"g":"to have","l":"avoir"},{"g":"to take","l":"prendre"},{"g":"the / it"},{"g":"control"},null,null,null],"phrases":[[6,8,"of the"]]},{"text":"Quelle fut la première capitale du Portugal ?","en":"What was the first capital of Portugal?","words":[{"g":"which?"},{"g":"bole","l":"fût"},{"g":"the / her"},{"g":"first","l":"premier"},null,{"g":"of the / some"},null]}]}